    "show_share": true,
    "description": "''May my words ignite a spark in all to always think creatively and outside the box...,\"commented Nafeesa Jalal, a public health consultant, during her five minutes at the third edition of the Ignite Karachi series held at Aga Khan University today. Ignite Karachi, a timed talk series, is organised by the Critical Creative Innovative Thinking (CCIT) group and is intended to light a spark in the audience to think differently.",
